{{block center|<math>(m+n)(f,\phi)^1_y = nf.\phi^1_y + mf^1_y.\phi,</math>}}
and
{{block center|<math>f,\phi^1_y - f_y.\phi = (a_x b_y - a_y b_x)\, a_x^{m-1} b_x^{n-1} = (xy)(f,\phi)^1;</math>}}
{{block center|<math>\therefore (f,\phi)^1 = f^1_y.\phi + \frac{n}{m+n}(xy)(f,\phi)^1.</math>}}

Put <math>m-1</math> for <math>m</math>, <math>n-1</math> for <math>n</math>, and multiply through by <math>(ab)</math>; then
{{block center|<math>\{(f,\phi)\}^1_y = (ab)a_x^{m-2}a_y b_x^{n-1} + \frac{n-1}{m+n-2}(xy)(f,\phi)^2,</math>}}
{{block center|<math>= (ab)a_x^{m-1}b_x^{n-2}b_y - \frac{m-1}{m+n-2}(xy)(f,\phi)^2.</math>}}

Multiply by <math>c_x^{p-1}</math> and for <math>y_1</math>, <math>y_2</math> write <math>c_2</math>, <math>-c_1</math>; then the right-hand side becomes
{{block center|<math>(ab)(bc)a_x^{m-1}b_x^{n-2}c_x^{p-1} + \frac{m-1}{m+n-2}c_x^p(f,\phi)^2,</math>}}
of which the first term, writing <math>c_x^p = \psi</math>, is
{{block center|<math>a_x^{m-2}b_x^{n-2}c_x^{p-2}(ab)(bc)a_x c_x</math>}}
{{block center|<math>= -\frac{1}{2}a_x^{m-2}b_x^{n-2}c_x^{p-2}\left\{(bc)^2a_x^2 + (ab)^2c_x^2 - (ac)^2b_x^2\right\}</math>}}
{{block center|<math>= -\frac{1}{2}\left\{a_x^m(bc)^2b_x^{n-2}c_x^{p-2} + c_x^p(ab)^2a_x^{m-2}b_x^{n-2} - b_x^n(ac)^2a_x^{m-2}c_x^{p-2}\right\}</math>}}
{{block center|<math>= -\frac{1}{2}\left\{(\phi,\psi)^2.f + (f,\phi)^2.\psi - (f,\psi)^2.\phi\right\};</math>}}
and, if <math>(f,\phi)^1 = k_x^{m+n-2}</math>,
{{block center|<math>\left\{(f,\phi)^1\right\}^1_y.c_x^{p-1} = k_x^{m+n-3}k_y c_x^{p-1};</math>}}
